  "limits": [
    "native VM scope: 1/2/4 active xAPIC CPUs, fixed process affinity, serialized kernel",
    "ACPI MADT, xAPIC, 64-bit HPET and startup page 0x8000 required",
    "x87/SSE state; no AVX, migration, file paging, Windows apps or installer",
    "8 thread slots, 2 address spaces, 16 anonymous VM pages per space",
    "early allocator manages conventional memory below 1 GiB",
    "one marked v2 AHCI 16 MiB/512-byte-sector volume; 4 KiB DMA batches and one outstanding request",
    "bounded ext2: 4 KiB blocks, 512 inodes, 12 direct blocks/48 KiB per file, 63-byte UTF-8 names, 255-byte absolute paths",
    "8 trusted-kernel file handles; exact case/UTF-8, no hard/symbolic links or guest ACL adapters",
    "dirty-volume write refusal and offline recovery to a new copy; no journal or universal power-loss recovery",
    "QEMU xHCI direct-root boot keyboard/mouse, MSI/MSI-X, two devices/four enumeration attempts; no hubs/hotplug",
